body:
Hi {{first_name}},

Your marked work is now available.

Result
------
  Assignment: {{title}}
  Subject:    {{subject_name}}
  Marker:     {{teacher}}
  Marks:      {{marks}} / {{max_marks}}
  Grade:      {{grade}}

Feedback
--------
{{feedback}}

What to do next
---------------
  - Read the feedback properly, then confirm you have read it in the portal. Your teacher can see who has and hasn't.
  - Write down one thing you will do differently next time. That is the part that moves your grade, not the number.
  - If something is unclear, ask {{teacher}} before the next piece rather than after it.

If you think the mark is wrong
------------------------------
You have {{appeal_days}} days from today to request a remark through the portal. Say specifically what you think was misjudged and why — "I expected more" is not grounds, but "the mark scheme credits X and I have done X in paragraph 3" is.

{{teacher}}
{{system_name}}
